%% 06-lists.mgp - learn MagicPoint on gucOS, deck 6 of 10 (todos/0202).
%% Tab-depth lists: %tab preamble styles, %icon shapes. Body list lines
%% below start with REAL tab characters.
%deffont "standard" tfont "/usr/share/fonts/mono.ttf"
%default 1 area 90 90, size 2, fore "white", back "MidnightBlue", font "standard"
%default 2 size 9, vgap 20, prefix " ", center
%default 3 size 5, fore "yellow", vgap 30
%tab 1 size 5, vgap 40, prefix "  ", icon box "SpringGreen" 50, left
%tab 2 size 4, vgap 40, prefix "      ", icon arc "gold" 50, left
%tab 3 size 3, vgap 40, prefix "          ", icon delta3 "white" 40, left
%tab 4 size 3, vgap 40, prefix "              ", icon dia "orchid" 40, left
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Lists

deck 6 of 10: tabs, bullets, icons
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The mechanism

	a line starting with TABs is a list item
	its DEPTH is simply the tab count
		two tabs, second level
			three tabs, third level
	each level's look is set in the preamble
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

\%tab - level styles

%size 4, fore "white", left
this deck's preamble says:

%size 3, fore "gray70", prefix "   "
tab 1 size 5, prefix "  ", icon box "SpringGreen" 50, left
tab 2 size 4, prefix "      ", icon arc "gold" 50, left

%size 4, fore "white"
any directive list works: size, color, prefix,
vgap, an icon - applied whenever a line has N tabs
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

\%icon - the bullets

	box - a filled square
		arc - a filled circle
			delta3 - a small triangle
				dia - a diamond
	shapes: box, arc, delta1..delta4, dia
	color and size (% of char size) follow:
		icon box "SpringGreen" 50
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

A real outline

	why plain-text lists win
		reorder = move a line
		promote = delete a tab
	what to keep in mind
		parallel wording per level
		three levels is usually the ceiling
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

List craft

	one thought per bullet
	six bullets per page, tops
	sub-bullets support, never repeat
%pause
%size 4, center, fore "SpringGreen"

if a bullet needs two lines, it wants its own page
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The end

%size 4, center
next: 07-images.mgp
